{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Refined Quartz is created by smelting 1 ",["l","石英","Quartz"]," in a furnace with 1 coal for fuel. 1 ",["l","火水晶","Fire Quartz"]," can also be placed in a furnace with 1 coal to produce 3 Refined Quartz. It can also be obtained in a variety of ways."]],["p",["It can be sold for 50g. Until obtaining the ",["l","宝石复制机","Crystalarium"]," it is a lot faster and easier to obtain Refined Quartz via the ",["l","回收机","Recycling Machine"]," than from ",["l","石英","quartz"]," itself."]]]],["Locations",2,[["l",0,[[1,["Can very rarely be found in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"]," by breaking large crystals."]],[1,["Can be created by smelting 1 ",["l","石英","Quartz"]," in a ",["l","熔炉","furnace"]," with 1 ",["l","煤炭","Coal"],". Smelting takes 1.5 in-game hours."]],[1,["Can be created by smelting 1 ",["l","火水晶","Fire Quartz"]," in a ",["l","熔炉","furnace"]," with 1 ",["l","煤炭","Coal"],", which produces 3 Refined Quartz. Smelting takes 1.5 in-game hours."]],[1,["Can be created by ",["l","回收机","recycling"]," a ",["l","破损的CD","Broken CD"]," or ",["l","破损的眼镜","Broken Glasses"],"."]],[1,["Can occasionally be found in ",["l","垃圾桶","Garbage Can"],"s after receiving the ",["l","熔炉","Furnace"]," blueprints from ",["l","克林特","Clint"],"."]],[1,["Can be a rare drop from ",["l","幽灵","Ghost"],"s in ",["l","矿井","The Mines"],". (Floors 51-79)"]],[1,["Can be dropped by ",["l","石碳幽灵","Carbon Ghost"],"s in the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],". (10% chance)"]],[1,["Can be produced by ",["l","鬼鱼","Ghostfish"]," ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"],"s when the population reaches 9."]]]]]],["Crafting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]},{"h":1,"v":["Recipe Source"]}],[[["f","Crystal_Floor.png",48]],[["l","水晶地板","Crystal Floor"]," (5)"],["Place on the ground to create paths or to spruce up your floors."],[["i","(O)338","Refined Quartz ×1"]],[["f","Krobus_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"]," (500g)"]],[[["f","Crystal_Path.png",4